[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2480741744","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99331#issuecomment-2480741744","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99331","id":2480741744,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6T3R1w","user":{"login":"hrkm","id":230985,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDk4NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/230985?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm","html_url":"https://github.com/hrkm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-16T19:10:33Z","updated_at":"2024-11-16T19:10:33Z","body":"I have found a similar issue in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/95588, but in that one the reporter claims the controller does not work at all - and in my case I can see the controller works as expected in the `_Process` function. I'm testing with PS5 DualSense controller.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2480741744/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2480752870","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99331#issuecomment-2480752870","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99331","id":2480752870,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6T3Ujm","user":{"login":"hrkm","id":230985,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDk4NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/230985?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm","html_url":"https://github.com/hrkm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-16T19:36:04Z","updated_at":"2024-11-16T19:36:04Z","body":"I think it boils down further to `Input.IsActionJustPressed` which does not respond to axis changes, but is triggered by DPAD / keyboard presses.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2480752870/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2480756284","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99331#issuecomment-2480756284","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99331","id":2480756284,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6T3VY8","user":{"login":"hrkm","id":230985,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDk4NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/230985?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm","html_url":"https://github.com/hrkm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-16T19:44:59Z","updated_at":"2024-11-16T19:45:29Z","body":"Which is probably because that handler is based on physics frames as defined in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/5efd124ca10bf46df62fa2441d80589777e54a5a/core/input/input.cpp#L403-L406\r\nwhich I'm guessing might not be reporting for axis / joypad motion event?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2480756284/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2480759012","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99331#issuecomment-2480759012","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99331","id":2480759012,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6T3WDk","user":{"login":"hrkm","id":230985,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDk4NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/230985?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm","html_url":"https://github.com/hrkm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-16T19:54:25Z","updated_at":"2024-11-16T19:54:25Z","body":"Further down, the pressed is only being assigned if there was a value in cache\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/5efd124ca10bf46df62fa2441d80589777e54a5a/core/input/input.cpp#L890-L893\r\nbut the cache is possibly never set to true based on the device state, since it's axis motion, not a button press\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/5efd124ca10bf46df62fa2441d80589777e54a5a/core/input/input.cpp#L1390","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2480759012/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2480760237","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99331#issuecomment-2480760237","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99331","id":2480760237,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6T3WWt","user":{"login":"hrkm","id":230985,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDk4NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/230985?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm","html_url":"https://github.com/hrkm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-16T19:59:34Z","updated_at":"2024-11-16T19:59:34Z","body":"Looking at the entirety though it should have also worked for axis changes?\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/5efd124ca10bf46df62fa2441d80589777e54a5a/core/input/input.cpp#L875-L897","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2480760237/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2517903825","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99331#issuecomment-2517903825","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99331","id":2517903825,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WFCnR","user":{"login":"dulvui","id":12729238,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzI5MjM4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12729238?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dulvui","html_url":"https://github.com/dulvui","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dulvui/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dulvui/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dulvui/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dulvui/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dulvui/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dulvui/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dulvui/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dulvui/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dulvui/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-04T16:13:39Z","updated_at":"2024-12-04T16:13:39Z","body":"I faced the same issue on Godot 4.3.stable on Linux.\n\nTo solve it until fixed, I created this singleton with the two signals `r2` and `l2`, and the input actions `L2` and `R2`.\nTo note that I still wasn't able to use a InputEventAction with the input actions `L2` and `R2` as button shortcut. It seems to me that the Axis events somehow get flagged as handled by something else.\n\n```gdscript\nextends Node\n\nsignal r2\nsignal l2\n\nconst THRESHOLD: float = 1\n\n\n# action event\nvar trigger_right_event: InputEventAction\nvar trigger_left_event: InputEventAction\n\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tInputMap.add_action(\"L2\")\n\ttrigger_left_event = InputEventAction.new()\n\ttrigger_left_event.action = \"L2\"\n\ttrigger_left_event.pressed = true\n\n\tInputMap.add_action(\"R2\")\n\ttrigger_right_event = InputEventAction.new()\n\ttrigger_right_event.action = \"R2\"\n\ttrigger_right_event.pressed = false\n\n\nfunc _input(event: InputEvent) -> void:\n\tif not event is InputEventJoypadMotion:\n\t\treturn\n\t\n\tvar motion_event: InputEventJoypadMotion = event as InputEventJoypadMotion\n\n\tmatch motion_event.axis:\n\t\tJOY_AXIS_TRIGGER_LEFT:\n\t\t\tif motion_event.axis_value >= THRESHOLD:\n\t\t\t\tl2.emit()\n\t\t\t\tInput.parse_input_event(trigger_left_event)\t\n\t\tJOY_AXIS_TRIGGER_RIGHT:\n\t\t\tif motion_event.axis_value >= THRESHOLD:\n\t\t\t\tr2.emit()\n\t\t\t\tInput.parse_input_event(trigger_right_event)\t\n```\n\nThis helper singleton can then be used inside a Button script, assuming the singleton's name is JoypadAxisUtil\n```gdscript\nextends Button\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tJoypadAxisUtil.l2.connect(func() -> void: pressed.emit())\n```","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2517903825/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2518749097","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99331#issuecomment-2518749097","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99331","id":2518749097,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WIQ-p","user":{"login":"hrkm","id":230985,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDk4NQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/230985?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm","html_url":"https://github.com/hrkm","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hrkm/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-04T23:14:22Z","updated_at":"2024-12-04T23:14:22Z","body":"I ended up with using IsActionPressed in _process to manually trigger my input repeater timer in the game if it's not already running, and the rest just works afterwards. (it's board game, so you want to move the cursor selection between active grid fields one at a time, hence the timer - too many unnecessary details already, but wanted to give some context)\n\nIt does seem like a bug in 4.3 though, so hopefully someone more familiar with this part of the engine can fix it. I ended up as far as my previous comments point to, and it's likely the fix is somewhere in there to be made. I am using the pre-compiled version of the engine though, hence raising the issue.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2518749097/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2598318373","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99331#issuecomment-2598318373","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99331","id":2598318373,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6a3zEl","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-17T13:01:04Z","updated_at":"2025-01-17T13:01:04Z","body":"It may be a floating point precision issue. You can try reducing the strength so that you can use the axis to trigger the action event.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0710139d-7075-4fc1-be04-433d567d0bab)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2598318373/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2798519814","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99331#issuecomment-2798519814","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99331","id":2798519814,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mzgYG","user":{"login":"chiepomme","id":1144460,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNDQ0NjA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1144460?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chiepomme","html_url":"https://github.com/chiepomme","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chiepomme/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chiepomme/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chiepomme/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chiepomme/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chiepomme/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chiepomme/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chiepomme/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chiepomme/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chiepomme/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-12T06:17:20Z","updated_at":"2025-04-12T06:18:56Z","body":"I'm a beginner with Godot, and I ran into the same issue. I looked into the engine source code and noticed that `InputEventJoypadMotion` is excluded from shortcut processing at the following lines:\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/4d7c448a0a58ff4b14d4a06c4b1bb387b58f4508/scene/main/viewport.cpp#L3334-L3337\n\nI tried adding JoypadMotion to that list, similar to other event types. It did make it possible to trigger shortcuts with it, but the shortcuts fired every time the joypad motion event was received, not just once. I suspect that JoypadMotion was intentionally excluded because of this.\n\nI believe some mechanism similar to `Input.is_action_just_pressed()` might be necessary here, but as a beginner, I'm not sure what the proper approach would be to improve this.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2798519814/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2836935549","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99331#issuecomment-2836935549","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99331","id":2836935549,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6pGDN9","user":{"login":"MJacred","id":6639237,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MzkyMzc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6639237?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred","html_url":"https://github.com/MJacred","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MJacred/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-28T22:43:43Z","updated_at":"2025-04-28T22:48:28Z","body":"This seems to be a duplicate of https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/90516, though this issue has more analysis","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2836935549/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]